  "@type": "Recipe",
  "name": "Vanilla & Passion Fruit Meringues",
  "text": "Vanilla & Passion Fruit Meringues\n\nPreparation time: 20 minutes\n\nCooking time: 1 1/2 hours\n\nYield: 6 meringues\n\nIngredients\n\n1 vanilla pod,\n\n4 egg whites,\n\n100 g / 3 1/2 oz caster sugar,\n\n4 tbsp passion fruit seeds (approx 2 medium fruits)\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Preheat the oven to Gas mark 1/4 (90C).\n\n2. Split the vanilla pod lengthwise and scrape out the seeds. Set the seeds aside.\n\n3. Follow the preparation for classic meringues.",
  "prepTime": "PT20M",
  "recipeYield": "6 meringues",
  "recipeIngredient": [
    "1 vanilla pod,",
    "4 egg whites,",
    "100 g / 3 1/2 oz caster sugar,",
    "4 tbsp passion fruit seeds (approx 2 medium fruits)"
  ],
  "recipeInstructions": [
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "1. Preheat the oven to Gas mark 1/4 (90C)."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "2. Split the vanilla pod lengthwise and scrape out the seeds. Set the seeds aside."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "3. Follow the preparation for classic meringues."
    }
  ],
